tion</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["did test"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_c354517f9d009475" source="e_85c4c9586691083e" target="e_855cf0240c68c215"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be selected of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e71d687b2eed6bc8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Above: The incorrect Instance Start() overload being selected instead of the static method that we actually wanted</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be selected of</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be selected of"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_9888643dd3cce220" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_2558f91aff09f210"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">decided to go</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a8f5785086b5edad</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">After failing with Process.Start, we decided to go a different route</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">decided to go</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["decided to go"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_7511ee6e410e0b99" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_9e944eacda2bda8d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has parameterless constructor with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_10e44920a8ba0bb5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Based on our prior experience building .NET deserialization gadgets by hand, we knew that we could probably leverage System.Web.UI.LosFormatter, as it has a parameterless constructor with a useful Instance Method, Deserialize</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">has parameterless constructor with</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["has parameterless constructor with"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_878c67dc38732cda" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_935bce6bb24baa30"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">call Deserialize with base64-encoded string as</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c107c53a50879bac</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">We can call Deserialize with a base64-encoded string as the only argument, which in our case will be a deserialization gadget</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">call Deserialize with base64-encoded string as</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["call Deserialize with base64-encoded string as"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_d521fdcab2983054" source="e_935bce6bb24baa30" target="e_41977bbb956fd210"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be deserialization gadget in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7e5dda5416abfb16</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">We can call Deserialize with a base64-encoded string as the only argument, which in our case will be a deserialization gadget</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be deserialization gadget in</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be deserialization gadget in"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_763d29b57dd013eb" source="e_333716f10a881b90" target="e_56cf49120d554e7e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">deserialize</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2724a7b7f93a76d1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While CVE-2026-63520 is not a deserialization vulnerability, we can still use the type instantiation to instantiate a class with a method that can deserialize an object (and it’s familiar to us)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">deserialize</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["deserialize"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_242560b2809c84d2" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_a1dcdd289f57b065"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">'s familiar to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e484f2c101aca036</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While CVE-2026-63520 is not a deserialization vulnerability, we can still use the type instantiation to instantiate a class with a method that can deserialize an object (and it’s familiar to us)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">'s familiar to</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["'s familiar to"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_15e2119441448597" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_37381ef939a12f17"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">'s</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e627410b408f251d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While CVE-2026-63520 is not a deserialization vulnerability, we can still use the type instantiation to instantiate a class with a method that can deserialize an object (and it’s familiar to us)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">'s</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["'s"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_c7923179d935e764" source="e_218a3c77a2b65233" target="e_90cde5114c5028dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">makes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d83c408279f22db9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">We’ll pause for a minute to talk about the concept that makes the Deserialize method run: the Finder</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">make</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["make", "makes"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_6448d3ac92b04155" source="e_d322780a4a3f2bc1" target="e_218a3c77a2b65233"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be talk about</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_00d3ce4c03ada080</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">We’ll pause for a minute to talk about the concept that makes the Deserialize method run: the Finder</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be talk about</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be talk about"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_fe1c0a6e3e5880d2" source="e_673011daa181069a" target="e_412e09614a52166e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be run method with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4ae42a1e3e9b3503</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">We weren’t able to simply say, “hey, run this method with these arguments.” We needed to bind some method from our .NET assembly to a method that SharePoint would expect to use to perform a CRUD operation, so we chose to bind it to one of the most common options: Finder</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be run method with</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be run method with"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_8a61e6b174c49572" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">chose to bind</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e18c1db859ec1bb7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">We weren’t able to simply say, “hey, run this method with these arguments.” We needed to bind some method from our .NET assembly to a method that SharePoint would expect to use to perform a CRUD operation, so we chose to bind it to one of the most common options: Finder</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">chose to bind</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["chose to bind"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_8f4c3b6d4b62ceec" source="e_791de43fccfd7f2f" target="e_3f3e6e2f2051ffbe"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">expect method to use to perform</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8770c4fa5eeca024</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">We weren’t able to simply say, “hey, run this method with these arguments.” We needed to bind some method from our .NET assembly to a method that SharePoint would expect to use to perform a CRUD operation, so we chose to bind it to one of the most common options: Finder</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">expect method to use to perform</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["expect method to use to perform"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_750e8c836e112260" source="e_791de43fccfd7f2f" target="e_27db1066555565aa"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">calls to fetch</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_19900d9215a53d4a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A Finder is the method SharePoint calls to fetch an entity's rows, and it fires automatically the moment someone views the associated External List</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">calls to fetch</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["calls to fetch"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_6c8bd07e308ad8ad" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_420d83e7a647c63c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">fires</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c68ac57c32b3f8c3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A Finder is the method SharePoint calls to fetch an entity's rows, and it fires automatically the moment someone views the associated External List</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">fires</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["fires"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_20fa39f867d318f1" source="e_aa82b47092bf3bff" target="e_7e30da1dff7161e8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">views associated External List</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_11c370a60a0a4fa9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A Finder is the method SharePoint calls to fetch an entity's rows, and it fires automatically the moment someone views the associated External List</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">views associated External List</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["views associated External List"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_c04df7ec21fe2c20" source="e_333716f10a881b90" target="e_61c59219f51b481d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">needed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_be26d6b67600a32f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Our method needed a return value, because by convention, it has to return a collection (type: IEnumerable)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">needed</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["needed"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_30e4426da1372e48" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_a3f531ace96a3b4e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has to return collection by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c37dabda050adebd</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Our method needed a return value, because by convention, it has to return a collection (type: IEnumerable)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">has to return collection by</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["has to return collection by"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_b3e83df9bc749aa3" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_7c9c1b4b7f88a6e8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has to return</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0733143c695d850b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Our method needed a return value, because by convention, it has to return a collection (type: IEnumerable)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">has to return</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["has to return"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_43d71fa9c8738e9b" source="e_142989eed857e8d9" target="e_da5a25a5e9f92b5a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">gets SharePoint to run</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_101eb5904570d25d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">So binding our Deserialize method to the Finder type and giving it an IEnumerable return value is what gets SharePoint to run it for us, just by querying the list</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">gets SharePoint to run</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["gets SharePoint to run"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_94fdc98963b5ca07" source="e_142989eed857e8d9" target="e_a1dcdd289f57b065"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">gets SharePoint to run it for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c83254af428b7529</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">So binding our Deserialize method to the Finder type and giving it an IEnumerable return value is what gets SharePoint to run it for us, just by querying the list</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">gets SharePoint to run it for</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["gets SharePoint to run it for"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_fa7308ef1a26ef8a" source="e_142989eed857e8d9" target="e_a1dcdd289f57b065"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be run it for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1b8a9e2b7aca68bb</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">So binding our Deserialize method to the Finder type and giving it an IEnumerable return value is what gets SharePoint to run it for us, just by querying the list</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be run it for</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be run it for"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_5fe7eb9553fffabf" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_ea8cac09369b3110"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">define</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1d921204f76925ae</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A Method is something we would usually define in a model to do something, like “get a specific value from the database.” In the Method, the two important bits inside of the Method are Parameter and MethodInstance</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">define</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["define", "defines"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_7f028ddb8c279b5a" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_ea8cac09369b3110"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">define in model to do something</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_660ce1d11f7b4c4e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A Method is something we would usually define in a model to do something, like “get a specific value from the database.” In the Method, the two important bits inside of the Method are Parameter and MethodInstance</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">define in model to do something</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["define in model to do something"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_bd4fcd7202468bef" source="e_05a359b3cdf8c0f2" target="e_333716f10a881b90"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">defines argument for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_eda80cd4858a7c33</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A Parameter defines an argument for a Method, or a return type for the Method</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">defines argument for</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["defines argument for"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_0adef042fa6788fc" source="e_05a359b3cdf8c0f2" target="e_105e1f9e7fc2fc5b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">defines</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_84501e2cd46a3a4a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A Parameter defines an argument for a Method, or a return type for the Method</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">define</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["define", "defines"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_ddb71ce276795d6a" source="e_6528b59578cac1f9" target="e_05a359b3cdf8c0f2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">define DefaultValues for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_57c3c7b41850baca</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A TypeDescriptor can also define DefaultValues for the parameter so we don’t need to pass them as arguments to the method</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">define DefaultValues for</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["define DefaultValues for"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_364dac18fab0d07a" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_21b08d533d49d334"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">do need to pass</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d09471bdaf001d17</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A TypeDescriptor can also define DefaultValues for the parameter so we don’t need to pass them as arguments to the method</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">do need to pass</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["do need to pass"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_25c12968f678d6bc" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_f8b520c0a0b6460f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">do need to pass</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b2ba46cb98c28f14</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A TypeDescriptor can also define DefaultValues for the parameter so we don’t need to pass them as arguments to the method</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">do need to pass</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["do need to pass"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_80a9e07411af9aa9" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_d72508b1b551ad60"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">defined MethodInstance as</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_643e8fd8617e56b4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Returning to the MethodInstance from earlier, we defined a MethodInstance as a Finder, and then placed that MethodInstance inside the Deserialize method to bind them together</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">defined MethodInstance as</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["defined MethodInstance as"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_08f40690c8875f5f" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_a1ed22474b9f1586"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">defined</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_59dd0ade6aaae366</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Returning to the MethodInstance from earlier, we defined a MethodInstance as a Finder, and then placed that MethodInstance inside the Deserialize method to bind them together</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">are defined</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["are defined", "defined", "has defined"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_c60fd09a633c3069" source="e_89fcb3c941a9d73f" target="e_f8b520c0a0b6460f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">to bind together</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a74a17f6567db7cf</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Returning to the MethodInstance from earlier, we defined a MethodInstance as a Finder, and then placed that MethodInstance inside the Deserialize method to bind them together</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">to bind together</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["to bind together"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_c9d359a4373b8f2a" source="e_89fcb3c941a9d73f" target="e_f8b520c0a0b6460f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">to bind</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ae31a72c7b8026b7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Returning to the MethodInstance from earlier, we defined a MethodInstance as a Finder, and then placed that MethodInstance inside the Deserialize method to bind them together</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">to bind</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["to bind"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_c39612bd4f2afac1" source="e_76a5b17823bcf140" target="e_2bf53cd61f9bd4ff"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be process</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_47ee493014d5762b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C09</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">As mentioned earlier, we also needed to make a request to process this model</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be process</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be process"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_9358715d6c07133a" source="e_2bf53cd61f9bd4ff" target="e_667187e9699b6e23"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">was uploaded in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_60dec324b2825486</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C09</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">It registers a new external list bound to the model that was uploaded in the previous request</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">was uploaded in</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["was uploaded in"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_4cbaad923f23ff2f" source="e_cc8e0f2c7e3a5b7e" target="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">read from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_785ab490cfbef640</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C10</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The last request simply calls the list and tries to read from it, which invokes the Finder (Deserialize)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">read from</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["read from"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_8841631a9cd426a0" source="e_3cf7563b65c90e7c" target="e_a27d5a1f835fc3ca"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be deserializing it via</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_328c63a3c0716ee5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C10</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">And there we have it: Using a LosFormatted TypeConfuseDelegate that runs calc, deserializing it via the BDCM .NET type and method definitions, and pairing with the CVE-2026-55040 authentication bypass, we achieved a fully authenticated deserialization that executes a calc process on our vulnerable SharePoint server</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be deserializing it via</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be deserializing it via"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_c66c063068461e85" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_a8d6efd59893e0d8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">NET type achieved</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7bebc2795ab8ade5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C10</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">And there we have it: Using a LosFormatted TypeConfuseDelegate that runs calc, deserializing it via the BDCM .NET type and method definitions, and pairing with the CVE-2026-55040 authentication bypass, we achieved a fully authenticated deserialization that executes a calc process on our vulnerable SharePoint server</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">NET type achieved</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["NET type achieved"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_f527c7a6ce99ec25" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_a8d6efd59893e0d8"><data key="edge_predicate_r