"edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">allowed attacker to maintain</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["allowed attacker to maintain"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_0f7be31001e2d03b" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_3da1d953b95fa2e5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">bypass</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_056ae5532086819a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An outbound connection is particularly useful to an intruder because it can bypass security controls designed primarily to prevent unsolicited inbound access</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">bypass</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["bypass"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_2dc32bedd43dfcf2" source="e_3709b11f96009c9b" target="e_f7bbf3d7131b8e6f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be designed to prevent</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6bb1a85705621cb8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An outbound connection is particularly useful to an intruder because it can bypass security controls designed primarily to prevent unsolicited inbound access</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be designed to prevent</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be designed to prevent"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_d7e3e87a65333da0" source="e_36ac3d09ab0a0f06" target="e_6bec2bc2b6526e74"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be requiring</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_513ef908cfb9c917</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In combination with unauthorized installation, unexpected outbound connections or execution on a vulnerable vCenter appliance, however, it is a high-priority indicator requiring investigation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be requiring</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be requiring"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_d23833c48a08c9c3" source="e_0c150b2def074ef8" target="e_5746627003daa98e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be treated as</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b26075a8ba357e61</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Because reverse_ssh is a legitimate dual-use security tool, a match should be treated as an investigative lead and correlated to other signs of compromise</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be treated as</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be treated as"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_f000211b39cf653e" source="e_07185c83b23959fb" target="e_916d3dba1003ded5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is available through</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1bc736ea3c1fef3f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The rule is available through QUIRSO’s GitHub account (link)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">is available through</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["is available through"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_e1c4ae87fc4a607e" source="e_f61b2511604369e2" target="e_e9f15699c9a49a02"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be observed during</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_96b51eaedbaabd90</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A detailed follow-up publication will examine the attacker’s tradecraft, infrastructure, persistence mechanisms and post-exploitation activity observed during the intrusion</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be observed during</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be observed during"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_f69fb4c40816c82d" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_3a40d0598e8cf21b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">provide</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ceef9f6d7eb47d30</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">It will also provide additional detection and investigation guidance</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">provides</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["provides", "provide"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_48695b9eb86db77b" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_e6a0c3130dca7a3e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">provide</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_532dadd8cf842211</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">It will also provide additional detection and investigation guidance</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">provides</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["provides", "provide"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_4e31af44628a0ac2" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_bfb0532aba1b9880"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">continued</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9a06e149635f8250</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">As announced in our initial analysis, we continued investigating the infrastructure and activity associated with the exploitation of CVE-2026–59310</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">reported</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">continued</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["continued"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_0ea8f1e91ad7fe6b" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_2a37188ec4262f5a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">continued</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fb5ab0ea11fd36b2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">As announced in our initial analysis, we continued investigating the infrastructure and activity associated with the exploitation of CVE-2026–59310</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">reported</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">continued</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["continued"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_d8b95b80d1d11cb7" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_475c08d1e2968507"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">expands beyond</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_79c31aa276d81aa8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">It expands beyond the initial victim telemetry and examines the broader campaign, including global exploitation activity, infrastructure and behavioral overlaps consistent with a suspected Chinese-nexus APT, and a potential connection to exploitation of the related CVE-2026–59309</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">expands beyond</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["expands beyond"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_c3d7a3ce942395a2" source="e_858ae4ca981225df" target="e_d807a778fb10fd20"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">overlaps consistent with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0c0e28f660ea348a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">It expands beyond the initial victim telemetry and examines the broader campaign, including global exploitation activity, infrastructure and behavioral overlaps consistent with a suspected Chinese-nexus APT, and a potential connection to exploitation of the related CVE-2026–59309</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">overlaps consistent with</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["overlaps consistent with"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_baeedd7788cd671d" source="e_757fed01c4b48a8a" target="e_d807a778fb10fd20"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">overlaps consistent with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_12a05a2909ff6ea7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">It expands beyond the initial victim telemetry and examines the broader campaign, including global exploitation activity, infrastructure and behavioral overlaps consistent with a suspected Chinese-nexus APT, and a potential connection to exploitation of the related CVE-2026–59309</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">overlaps consistent with</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["overlaps consistent with"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_9caf3669eb1543d7" source="e_b5a93c6f71d5fae1" target="e_d807a778fb10fd20"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">overlaps consistent with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2cab8548baddee86</data><data key="edge_source_id">S12</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://medium.com/@quirso_de/active-exploitation-of-cve-2026-59310-361-victim-ips-across-47-countries-9783187cc6ff</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">It expands beyond the initial victim telemetry and examines the broader campaign, including global exploitation activity, infrastructure and behavioral overlaps consistent with a suspected Chinese-nexus APT, and a potential connection to exploitation of the related CVE-2026–59309</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">overlaps consistent with</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["overlaps consistent with"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_71b9356350af12e4" source="e_83b5ca141669e4d1" target="e_38dfacfcc5bd0d18"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be où</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_5e9233083cfb39a2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S13</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.malwarebytes.com/blog/bugs/2026/08/update-your-mac-screen-sharing-vulnerability-exploited-in-the-wild</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Le Centre national néerlandais de cybersécurité (NCSC) a émis un avertissement après avoir été informé de plusieurs incidents où une vulnérabilité de la fonction de partage d'écran d'Apple a été exploitée pour installer des mineurs de cryptomonnaie Monero</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be où</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be où"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_5c82ac60d96a1122" source="e_75710dd52fb437c2" target="e_b7d7cf6d0d563e6d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be pour</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3f19416c51efb384</data><data key="edge_source_id">S13</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.malwarebytes.com/blog/bugs/2026/08/update-your-mac-screen-sharing-vulnerability-exploited-in-the-wild</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Le Centre national néerlandais de cybersécurité (NCSC) a émis un avertissement après avoir été informé de plusieurs incidents où une vulnérabilité de la fonction de partage d'écran d'Apple a été exploitée pour installer des mineurs de cryptomonnaie Monero</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be pour</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be pour"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_c53bec5746949a14" source="e_2b9318e921bf9351" target="e_2b9318e921bf9351"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">systèmes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_af8653c69d864939</data><data key="edge_source_id">S13</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.malwarebytes.com/blog/bugs/2026/08/update-your-mac-screen-sharing-vulnerability-exploited-in-the-wild</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Les systèmes les plus à risque sont donc ceux où le port 5900 est accessible depuis Internet, généralement via une redirection de port sur un routeur, une adresse IP publique ou une configuration chez un fournisseur d'hébergement</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">systèmes</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["systèmes"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_deb58926e01ed36d" source="e_06360ec0b124f534" target="e_2cb53923b139b1ae"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">à une application hautement spécialisés</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a6b74c179ad9966a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S13</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.malwarebytes.com/blog/bugs/2026/08/update-your-mac-screen-sharing-vulnerability-exploited-in-the-wild</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Les criminels ont probablement choisi le minage de Monero car il ne dépend pas de circuits intégrés spécifiques à une application (ASIC) hautement spécialisés, mais peut être effectué avec n'importe quel processeur ou GPU</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">à une application hautement spécialisés</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["à une application hautement spécialisés"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_e64ddd4efc1c4cb6" source="e_2bd570c5c598ca94" target="e_1e42dd8c727acb6b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">pour fonctionner de manière cohérente sur toutes les versions</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4937bb67d0fcecd2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S13</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.malwarebytes.com/blog/bugs/2026/08/update-your-mac-screen-sharing-vulnerability-exploited-in-the-wild</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Pour mettre à jour macOS sur n'importe quel Mac pris en charge, utilisez la fonctionnalité Mise à jour de logiciels, conçue par Apple pour fonctionner de manière cohérente sur toutes les versions récentes</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">pour fonctionner de manière cohérente sur toutes les versions</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["pour fonctionner de manière cohérente sur toutes les versions"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_fa243beaa9b81f6a" source="e_0bb670c5690aea48" target="e_81802b13413f8de7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">dans coin supérieur gauche de</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2269d926111533a0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S13</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.malwarebytes.com/blog/bugs/2026/08/update-your-mac-screen-sharing-vulnerability-exploited-in-the-wild</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Cliquez sur le menu Apple dans le coin supérieur gauche de votre écran</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">dans coin supérieur gauche de</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["dans coin supérieur gauche de"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_7835340b0828a2f9" source="e_f0d0aee842cd8611" target="e_1404d26bdf365133"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">die</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a05cced22ff5e89c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S14</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://advisories.ncsc.nl/2026/ncsc-2026-0280.html</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Hierdoor kunnen onbevoegden authenticatiepogingen uitvoeren die normaal niet geaccepteerd zouden worden</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">die</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["die"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_135bf491fca4cec8" source="e_611c12b0e2871193" target="e_8d85ae18e96f008d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">heeft</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d169b9b5aec565de</data><data key="edge_source_id">S14</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://advisories.ncsc.nl/2026/ncsc-2026-0280.html</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Update: Het NCSC heeft een melding ontvangen waaruit blijkt dat er actief misbruik van deze kwetbaarheid is waargenomen op meerdere systemen waarop poort 5900 vanaf het internet bereikbaar was</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">heeft</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["heeft"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_10c897c805ec844f" source="e_59f02bcf59bf3398" target="e_128c3638fc00e943"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">die</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d4548d17e5e30f73</data><data key="edge_source_id">S14</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://advisories.ncsc.nl/2026/ncsc-2026-0280.html</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Updates zijn uitgebracht die ervoor zorgen dat alleen geldige inloggegevens worden geaccepteerd</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">die</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["die"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_a51c0f8cf8101644" source="e_04500d9e7c9fe5a1" target="e_a0d268736fe7337d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">voor</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_df132014d45ba757</data><data key="edge_source_id">S14</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://advisories.ncsc.nl/2026/ncsc-2026-0280.html</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Zie bijgevoegde referenties voor meer informatie</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">voor</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["voor"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_2876346299aeee1a" source="e_96c95d6b17085bee" target="e_4e1521b9ceca8d20"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be enhance</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_150dbe271f3cde94</data><data key="edge_source_id">S14</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://advisories.ncsc.nl/2026/ncsc-2026-0280.html</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Netherlands Cyber Security Center (henceforth: NCSC-NL) maintains this page to enhance access to its information and security advisories</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be enhance</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be enhance"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_7d9ada32874d4c4d" source="e_96c95d6b17085bee" target="e_340cd9a372ccb88a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be enhance</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_69ed71fc4c897682</data><data key="edge_source_id">S14</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://advisories.ncsc.nl/2026/ncsc-2026-0280.html</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Netherlands Cyber Security Center (henceforth: NCSC-NL) maintains this page to enhance access to its information and security advisories</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be enhance</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be enhance"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_30ab55cb3a85fcb6" source="e_095f6032a2968d0f" target="e_8cbef56c0b7f066a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is kept up to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7f3f21dab0229829</data><data key="edge_source_id">S14</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://advisories.ncsc.nl/2026/ncsc-2026-0280.html</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The use of this security advisory is subject to the following terms and conditions: NCSC-NL makes every reasonable effort to ensure that the content of this page is kept up to date, and that it is accurate and complete</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">is kept up to</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["is kept up to"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_d61f5133a608ee10" source="e_2079f7f0585a6a0c" target="e_5af3793402bc5d04"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">contained in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_358e3577453a03f1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S14</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://advisories.ncsc.nl/2026/ncsc-2026-0280.html</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The information contained in this security advisory is intended solely for the purpose of providing general information to professional users</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">contained in</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["contained in"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_ee2adbf5c0aea350" source="e_2079f7f0585a6a0c" target="e_515e227b0b68b639"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be provided</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_da37cba4b04915cd</data><data key="edge_source_id">S14</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://advisories.ncsc.nl/2026/ncsc-2026-0280.html</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">No rights can be derived from the information provided therein</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical