formation about products not manufactured by Apple, or independent websites not controlled or tested by Apple, is provided without recommendation or endorsement</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be manufactured by</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be manufactured by"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_4c645e2e7241a89e" source="e_4a440f0d7f548662" target="e_2f5744d685c3e4d9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">configured multiple large language models In</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f0e5df20f25456a5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In parallel with their use of DeepSeek as their autonomous operator platform, the actor configured multiple large language models (LLMs) (Qwen, GLM, Kimi, MiniMax)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">configured multiple large language models In</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["configured multiple large language models In"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_f196bd4ddb85ad51" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_43bf6f75472c4ee4"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">identified testing of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_eb5b316eba6c1596</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">We also identified limited usage and testing of Western platforms</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">identified testing of</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["identified testing of"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_a246b01f9666f9be" source="e_e163460c91338b08" target="e_f2e696a2faefcf23"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">includes Claude Code for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cd35595ff0f4d155</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This includes Claude Code for connectivity testing and proxy validation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">includes Claude Code for</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["includes Claude Code for"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_e198f3df67758850" source="e_e163460c91338b08" target="e_e41c242ffb17575e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">includes Claude Code for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3f70c9d617ecac28</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This includes Claude Code for connectivity testing and proxy validation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">includes Claude Code for</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["includes Claude Code for"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_23849db0f39efd75" source="e_7eae8a764be9b4ce" target="e_cb202e188add8565"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">failed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_36cee6da95888081</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">When initial exploitation failed due to the target environment's restrictive configurations, their Hermes Agent autonomously conducted searches for known critical-severity Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVEs)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">failed</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["failed"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_24270f29ac3b14dd" source="e_445e91ae2bde06a7" target="e_57598c70746601d2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">had limited</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7017ecc78cf90d49</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While the observed campaign had limited impacts, the workflow confirms a functional, end-to-end autonomous offensive capability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">had limited</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["had limited"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_5909fde7d5bc7522" source="e_5cbfc157d33979df" target="e_211561b194ad87a9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be described</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1f27e3cc74c52e5f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Palo Alto Networks customers are better protected from the threats described here through the following products and services:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be described</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be described"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_0eda5f577e6e5efe" source="e_2f261ea475092193" target="e_f28a0ceb4119b20d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">help</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a0dba4a19876e7d4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Unit 42 AI Security Assessment and Unit 42 Frontier AI Defense service can help identify and mitigate complex AI-enabled risks</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">help</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["help"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_ca205c48732b55cf" source="e_2f261ea475092193" target="e_5561eb65bbb8faad"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">help</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7ec0aeef19891429</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Unit 42 AI Security Assessment and Unit 42 Frontier AI Defense service can help identify and mitigate complex AI-enabled risks</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">help</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["help"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_4b9a4718b5f0360a" source="e_2c7f52ae71073c01" target="e_1c863aa4b2c117cf"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has analysis of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e263281346a7b104</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Based on our analysis of their session logs and configuration files, the actor primarily used the Hermes Agent with DeepSeek as its reasoning agent for the attack phase of this campaign</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">has analysis of</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["has analysis of"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_0da6fddbaf21fe3b" source="e_2c7f52ae71073c01" target="e_0913bb4d85d0b322"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has analysis of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_43e1e96a48a85afa</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</d