"edge_predicate_raw">conducted autonomous vulnerability enumeration</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_97f1ab798e3a6d4d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Their Hermes Agent conducted autonomous vulnerability enumeration, downloaded public exploit code from the internet and attempted exploits against targets</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">conducted autonomous vulnerability enumeration</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["conducted autonomous vulnerability enumeration"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_f3d4b1eff3a93ef4" source="e_4a440f0d7f548662" target="e_f2e696a2faefcf23"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">used this for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_43360fb84452c64b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Claude Code: The actor only used this for connectivity testing and proxy validation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">used this for</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["used this for"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_61e48ac7aaa8dbce" source="e_4a440f0d7f548662" target="e_e41c242ffb17575e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">used this for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ee8ba952d53550ce</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Claude Code: The actor only used this for connectivity testing and proxy validation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">used this for</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["used this for"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_eb71d5a13fd547ad" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_01c8f876ade4c43e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">verify</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_77f0764cef868ce0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Although we cannot verify actual usage because the actor configured their system to limit local response storage (disable_response_storage = true), the correlation between trusted directories and successful campaigns is notable</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">verify</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["verify"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_658d721044bec39c" source="e_4a440f0d7f548662" target="e_64c4e8164db73472"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">configured system to limit</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_20ade192a79abf1a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Although we cannot verify actual usage because the actor configured their system to limit local response storage (disable_response_storage = true), the correlation between trusted directories and successful campaigns is notable</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">configured system to limit</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["configured system to limit"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_89a13d3fff5e7a0c" source="e_4a440f0d7f548662" target="e_64c4e8164db73472"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be limit</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_093b581eda2ec45d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Although we cannot verify actual usage because the actor configured their system to limit local response storage (disable_response_storage = true), the correlation between trusted directories and successful campaigns is notable</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be limit</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be limit"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_3a3921bf4dcaa839" source="e_4a440f0d7f548662" target="e_28a64b697e4cbab5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">accessed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8473f9177ef452e2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The actor accessed DeepSeek and Qwen directly through their native API endpoints</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">accessed</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["accessed"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_4eaa887fbc466cad" source="e_4a440f0d7f548662" target="e_641b5adba799053a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">accessed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3ec9b8c5a7e86f81</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The actor accessed DeepSeek and Qwen directly through their native API endpoints</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">accessed</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["accessed"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_a6bf7ca5c5da9282" source="e_4a440f0d7f548662" target="e_cb1ff57fe888ca98"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">enabled anti-attribution settings on</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0fe4a28d668d8eab</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The actor enabled anti-attribution settings on both tools</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">enabled anti-attribution settings on</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["enabled anti-attribution settings on"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_30ae9cbe0f52c481" source="e_4a35877597b8e55c" target="e_b073f9b05f1757fe"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">does impact retention of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e3342e366bbf5868</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Note: This setting does not impact the retention of logging or safety signals in OpenAI’s safety systems</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">does impact retention of</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["does impact retention of"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_86594bbccfc3d4b1" source="e_28a64b697e4cbab5" target="e_36ba6a25f72c0807"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be operating through</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d06e78d873510001</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">DeepSeek, operating through the Hermes Agent framework, served as the actor's primary offensive AI tool</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be operating through</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be operating through"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_b45fd3700987df05" source="e_28a64b697e4cbab5" target="e_ea61f6c511c294de"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">served as reasoning engine for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_904ffa3e1a967891</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Hermes Agent provided orchestration (terminal access, Telegram-based command and control, and the skills system) while DeepSeek served as the reasoning engine for code generation, vulnerability assessment, target selection and decision-making</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">served as reasoning engine for</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["served as reasoning engine for"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_6c9d8d130d36a051" source="e_f72b45612317d7b9" target="e_9415737df43b825d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be instructing DeepSeek to use</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_337c3230295595bf</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- fofa-cyberspace-search: a custom procedure template instructing DeepSeek to use the actor's fofoapi.py script for internet asset enumeration</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be instructing DeepSeek to use</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be instructing DeepSeek to use"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_286f649696a12fcd" source="e_28a64b697e4cbab5" target="e_3439326c903f4c24"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">identified attempted exploitation through</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_94020ff9f04c64fc</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">DeepSeek identified a Langflow vulnerability (CVE-2026-33017, CVSS 9.8) and autonomously attempted exploitation through the following steps:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">identified attempted exploitation through</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["identified attempted exploitation through"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_67df81ebb6d1f90e" source="e_3a786607c0f2f54e" target="e_65b2834b7db6279c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exploit from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_486f78952a249aa9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Downloading the public PoC exploit from GitHub</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">exploit from</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["exploit from"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_4bbc7f7a92bb6ab9" source="e_59681a253f62dce1" target="e_216e46c29b8634fa"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be requiring unauthenticated form with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9c06a37937976290</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The PoC chains two CVEs into an attack sequence requiring an unauthenticated form with file upload:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be requiring unauthenticated form with</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be requiring unauthenticated form with"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_8213a6d20ce09058" source="e_51706262689718e9" target="e_4043fae2dfe54945"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">ranges to identify</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f93b1b79f645d787</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">DeepSeek analyzed affected version ranges to identify exploitable targets:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">ranges to identify</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["ranges to identify"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_30d5f1f40b4a60ea" source="e_b5c1d9d9c6713fc0" target="e_6b12676fb23424d4"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">ends at</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fcd9b2dfbb43f0f1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The recovered session data ends at this point</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">ends at</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["ends at"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_ff55242af4a87f11" source="e_232ea3ebc61b8b8b" target="e_452a2739a3196a04"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be using conventional workflows with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c2e7ea9f69457ef8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Separate from the autonomous AI campaigns, the actor conducted manual operations using conventional workflows (FOFA enumeration, custom Python scanners and direct exploitation) with confirmed impact</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be using conventional workflows with</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be using conventional workflows with"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_c5ca4c9b346391fc" source="e_78ba4d5961028726" target="e_cca5b8f8a57c0186"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be responding to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bdb505219542af35</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Hermes Agent, responding to a Telegram command, started an HTTP file server (python3 -m http.server 8888) from the actor's home directory (/home/worker) rather than an isolated staging directory</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be responding to</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be responding to"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_47dce05bc480b69a" source="e_4a440f0d7f548662" target="e_3f1f902e60091908"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">demonstrated operational security awareness having emptied exploit directories after</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4cf2b8d9f4521540</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The actor demonstrated operational security awareness elsewhere, having emptied exploit directories after use and disabled Codex conversation logging</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">demonstrated operational security awareness having emptied exploit directories after</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["demonstrated operational security awareness having emptied exploit directories after"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_5cac0439c8656c8e" source="e_4a440f0d7f548662" target="e_e1a72f9424a49d82"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">demonstrated operational security awareness having emptied exploit directories after</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4b105a57b963da1c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The actor demonstrated operational security awareness elsewhere, having emptied exploit directories after use and disabled Codex conversation logging</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">demonstrated operational security awareness having emptied exploit directories after</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["demonstrated operational security awareness having emptied exploit directories after"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_27f0504d944c9096" source="e_290d8da624d84fb0" target="e_6e276e2587b5d5b5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">downloaded it from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cedc171be16e7c7f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The threat actor likely retrieved the tooling manually or they downloaded it from public repositories via the Hermes Agent during the autonomous scan -&gt; download -&gt; exploit cycles</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">downloaded it from</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["downloaded it from"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_ef8dc07bcc368934" source="e_290d8da624d84fb0" target="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">downloaded</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_aa5aed1cb155acff</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The threat actor likely retrieved the tooling manually or they downloaded it from public repositories via the Hermes Agent during the autonomous scan -&gt; download -&gt; exploit cycles</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">downloaded</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["downloaded"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_27a2146caf0f88b1" source="e_72899634de1b0835" target="e_f1b6c2a488425b3a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is buffer overflow vulnerability in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cf383ff4434ba5de</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The actor cloned a public repository (qassam-315/PAN-OS-User-ID-Buffer-Overflow-PoC) for CVE-2026-0300, a buffer overflow vulnerability in the PAN-OS User-ID Authentication Portal (Captive Portal)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">is buffer overflow vulnerability in</data><data key="edge_domain">CVE</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["is buffer overflow vulnerability in"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_d4d91ed2e903fce7" source="e_d273cb70ce73d149" target="e_95af6bc916b10a2b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">achieve</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6ee94f3de07c8cf5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The cloned code is non-functional with placeholder values that cannot achieve code execution</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">achieve</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["achieve"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_faeb8808133245b9" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_2fca61518b1f3778"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be checking version via</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8ea6f941ed7e7a26</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Of those 100 systems, it probed roughly 40 unique IP addresses, checking their version via curl commands</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be checking version via</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be checking version via"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_ed30ae17d947016f" source="e_28a64b697e4cbab5" target="e_7764b8b24f6c0608"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">found</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cd276ad9a27c4ad4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While most of the systems were unreachable or non-responsive, DeepSeek found three with the vulnerable versions and attempted to exploit them automatically</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">found</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["found"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_30a5a5a70889e5ee" source="e_93d8650fe6b85a54" target="e_8e21c5a475559676"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">executed hundreds of hours of manual targeting analysis in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b914be475822be21</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This autonomous process of target identification, sampling and narrowing of scope is notable because the system executed hundreds of hours of manual targeting analysis in mere minutes, while also managing its own compute resources</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">executed hundreds of hours of manual targeting analysis in</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["executed hundreds of hours of manual targeting analysis in"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_09f810efe014aa06" source="e_93d8650fe6b85a54" target="e_8e21c5a475559676"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">executed hundreds of hours of manual targeting analysis in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_458c3e9bb31478f2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C06</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">identification, sampling and narrowing of scope is notable because the system executed hundreds of hours of manual targeting analysis in mere minutes, while also managing its own compute resources</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">executed hundreds of hours of manual targeting analysis in</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["executed hundreds of hours of manual targeting analysis in"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_651009f260ee96bb" source="e_8618e70bc35c7ea5" target="e_f62b55a120731786"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">were listed in file deleted by actor to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b9373e4cfdf46887</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C06</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">However, we reviewed evidence of batch exploitation against an unknown number of hosts that were listed in a file deleted by the actor prior to our analysis</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">uncertain</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">were listed in file deleted by actor to</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["were listed in file deleted by actor to"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_7fd21c162914304c" source="e_8618e70bc35c7ea5" target="e_4a440f0d7f548662"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">were listed in file deleted by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f70bd145ee3b45f1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C06</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Ho