 processes retarget without</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_63f083e7f2eee5af</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C06</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This research validates an emerging threat posed by AI-enabled attackers as they hone their autonomous attack processes to discover, assess, pivot and retarget without human intervention</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">hone autonomous attack processes retarget without</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["hone autonomous attack processes retarget without"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_45354cf426bba74d" source="e_618d93742ee02dc6" target="e_2b74a6a4bd535719"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">was prevented by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_41f0d7ff40d5b367</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C06</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Autonomous AI-driven attack cycles are operationally viable, and the margin of failure was narrow: Exploitation was prevented by target-side configuration requirements — the absence of prerequisite workflow configurations (Langflow) and authentication on form endpoints (n8n)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">was prevented by</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["was prevented by"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_883a295034fce4fa" source="e_ff0251d80d2ce1d2" target="e_d80b6d35ff4f4235"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are constructing persistent AI offensive infrastructure Rather than using AI tools in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f2e50678fae786de</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Threat actors are constructing persistent AI offensive infrastructure: Rather than using AI tools in isolation, this actor assembled an integrated environment — custom automation skills, MCP server integration, proxy anonymization, and Telegram-based command and control — designed to retain and reuse successful procedures across sessions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">are constructing persistent AI offensive infrastructure Rather than using AI tools in</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["are constructing persistent AI offensive infrastructure Rather than using AI tools in"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_87cc1006d8f169b7" source="e_ff0251d80d2ce1d2" target="e_a286b3bec1094d96"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are constructing</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_453cd4abfd77042d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Threat actors are constructing persistent AI offensive infrastructure: Rather than using AI tools in isolation, this actor assembled an integrated environment — custom automation skills, MCP server integration, proxy anonymization, and Telegram-based command and control — designed to retain and reuse successful procedures across sessions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">are constructing</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["are constructing"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_5cf0a6c35684a71a" source="e_b318349d684cc484" target="e_47ea552dd1dc99e6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be designed to retain successful procedures across</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7defe18fdcdd3b07</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Threat actors are constructing persistent AI offensive infrastructure: Rather than using AI tools in isolation, this actor assembled an integrated environment — custom automation skills, MCP server integration, proxy anonymization, and Telegram-based command and control — designed to retain and reuse successful procedures across sessions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be designed to retain successful procedures across</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be designed to retain successful procedures across"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_ee489fa3c2fefb5a" source="e_b318349d684cc484" target="e_78694cc827475805"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be designed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f276cfe923bd6bcd</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Threat actors are constructing persistent AI offensive infrastructure: Rather than using AI tools in isolation, this actor assembled an integrated environment — custom automation skills, MCP server integration, proxy anonymization, and Telegram-based command and control — designed to retain and reuse successful procedures across sessions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be designed</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be designed"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_5fe1d757a9da3627" source="e_ff0251d80d2ce1d2" target="e_6a0030cfbdbd1e2c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">follow path of least resistance For</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a782481bbccdcb22</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Threat actors follow the path of least resistance: For their autonomous attack engine, the actor selected a model with minimal safety controls (DeepSeek) accessed through an open-source framework with no client-side restrictions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">follow path of least resistance For</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["follow path of least resistance For"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_b47fa95b1e317d5a" source="e_ff0251d80d2ce1d2" target="e_c239eaca20a04eba"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">follow path of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_be6f9cc8866cdae1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Threat actors follow the path of least resistance: For their autonomous attack engine, the actor selected a model with minimal safety controls (DeepSeek) accessed through an open-source framework with no client-side restrictions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">follow path of</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["follow path of"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_4b44692c269a6987" source="e_092e4fae98c75726" target="e_f96a1cdeac1045fc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refused</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_5d7eeb3b1e54a7ac</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Note: Our colleagues at OpenAI were able to confirm that their provider-side safeguards refused requests that violated their policies</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">refused</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["refused"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_f53b850d30eec25a" source="e_2c7f52ae71073c01" target="e_9ff1c8657d16596d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has colleagues at</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9a16afb4faf00704</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Note: Our colleagues at OpenAI were able to confirm that their provider-side safeguards refused requests that violated their policies</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">has colleagues at</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["has colleagues at"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_cf13d64f7d299762" source="e_e2b63fafa72577da" target="e_db54dc8bacec8989"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">led safety systems to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a726035d2825b0a5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">They also confirmed that continued attempts led their safety systems to flag and disable an account they believe is linked to this campaign prior to our intelligence sharing with their team</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">led safety systems to</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["led safety systems to"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_747d27ef587b45f7" source="e_290d8da624d84fb0" target="e_a2152b2dd5e94ca3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">believe</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0506a77997df0a2c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_pa