pts led their safety systems to flag and disable an account they believe is linked to this campaign prior to our intelligence sharing with their team</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">has intelligence sharing with</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["has intelligence sharing with"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_35b02ce31c648273" source="e_e73b58cd53930cb4" target="e_7f1f6c82d4c24b3a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be sharing with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a89005e3f0ba22c1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">They also confirmed that continued attempts led their safety systems to flag and disable an account they believe is linked to this campaign prior to our intelligence sharing with their team</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be sharing with</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be sharing with"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_cdb45035e540d881" source="e_4a440f0d7f548662" target="e_5d6d7e07239d0935"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">developed for offensive use</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9836a8fff21f0086</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Autonomous AI execution introduces novel operational security risks 