ata><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be enforcing"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_7d2545c220ff2e0c" source="e_6d1f792ed874739b" target="e_2faf8dcd239851ee"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be enforcing</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b5d1fec0ec7d1819</data><data key="edge_source_id">S17</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://diesec.com/2026/08/top-5-cybersecurity-news-stories-august-21-2026/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S17_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The operational consequence of CVE-2026-20349 is more significant than a standard denial-of-service finding because of what Cisco ASA and FTD appliances are: simultaneously the firewall enforcing the network security perimeter and the VPN concentrator providing remote access to the corporate network</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be enforcing</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be enforcing"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_f9f269c3129cee56" source="e_1f403ee7b6908ac1" target="e_4d7e31926be02e81"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be providing</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_03d5d7ecc589e056</data><data key="edge_source_id">S17</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://diesec.com/2026/08/top-5-cybersecurity-news-stories-august-21-2026/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S17_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The operational consequence of CVE-2026-20349 is more significant than a standard denial-of-service finding because of what Cisco ASA and FTD appliances are: simultaneously the firewall enforcing the network security perimeter and the VPN concentrator providing remote access to the corporate network</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie<