ta><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["set"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_97aa384e8ed1897d" source="e_20617c6c62d27119" target="e_4c34f849d90824e5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">have automated vulnerability reporting through</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c19c67b83fcc402d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Agencies that have not fully automated their vulnerability reporting through the CDM Program must regularly report this information to CISA every seven days using a CISA-approved, machine-readable format and following CISA reporting instructions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">have automated vulnerability reporting through</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["have automated vulnerability reporting through"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_b9da6d9183606685" source="e_98b5283953a5c25e" target="e_4c34f849d90824e5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has vulnerability reporting through</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b543f1d64d14a593</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Agencies that have not fully automated their vulnerability reporting through the CDM Program must regularly report this information to CISA every seven days using a CISA-approved, machine-readable format and following CISA reporting instructions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">has vulnerability reporting through</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["has vulnerability reporting through"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_df072887f414b933" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_4c34f849d90824e5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be reporting through</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8310fe40d20f5793</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Agencies that have not fully automated their vulnerability reporting through the CDM Program must regularly report this information to CISA every seven days using a CISA-approved, machine-readable format and following CISA reporting instructions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be reporting through</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be reporting through"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_43889a11bb3e965e" source="e_f887edd13e8c0fb9" target="e_630e55793d0ac463"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">include</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d75ce9cf9d3fc7f2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Tags must include the following information:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">include</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["include", "includes"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_d7cac7b3549bb86e" source="e_dd96f30da73ff3c3" target="e_a8d26afc3bec0fed"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">matches</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_18135153cbf25383</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Update the catalog as quickly as possible and ensure it can publish updates at a pace that matches the rate at which CISA identifies new KEVs</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">matches</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["matches"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_d402403b00b728f7" source="e_6f7684418f21aa11" target="e_a8d26afc3bec0fed"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">identifies new KEVs</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_58b6a18750fdf9de</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Update the catalog as quickly as possible and ensure it can publish updates at a pace that matches the rate at which CISA identifies new KEVs</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">identifies new KEVs</data><data key="e