e_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In the rare event that there is a CVSS, CWE, or CPE string provided by the originating CNA and the CISA ADP, the originating CNA’s data should take precedence for any decision making</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">take precedence</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["take precedence"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_4aade101983cb7e2" source="e_b823c9d95d8545ae" target="e_2079f7f0585a6a0c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is updated by originating CNA to provide</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_eab3ebc54d70ef37</data><data key="edge_source_id">S38</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cve.org/ProgramOrganization/ADPs</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Similarly, if a CVE Record is updated by the originating CNA to provide information that would impact the SSVC decision points, those SSVC decision points will be updated shortly thereafter by the CISA ADP</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">is updated by originating CNA to provide</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["is updated by originating CNA to provide"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_7d13f73111321fa6" source="e_b823c9d95d8545ae" target="e_2079f7f0585a6a0c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is updated to provide</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8fb033f5eaf6cd5d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S38</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cve.org/ProgramOrganization/ADPs</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Similarly, if a CVE Record is updated by the originating CNA to provide information that would impact the SSVC decision points, those SSVC decision points will be updated shortly thereafter by the CISA ADP</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">is updated to provide</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["is updated to provide"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_f4259de5ffd718a7" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_6222cbe778251f55"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">describes conditions beyond</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_55e11a6563e01ec9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the conditions beyond the attacker’s control that must exist in order to exploit the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">describes conditions beyond</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["describes conditions beyond"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_d569197310b91931" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_1b50c049dec6c218"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">describes level of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_df82fabd89e430be</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the level of privileges an attacker must possess before successfully exploiting the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">describes level of</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["describes level of"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_4672b5c5626cfae5" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_1b50c049dec6c218"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">possess before exploiting vulnerability</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_39d92a51c83234cf</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the level of privileges an attacker must possess before successfully exploiting the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">possess before exploiting vulnerability</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["possess before exploiting vulnerability"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_ca30f7b072aeb977" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_1b50c049dec6c218"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">possess</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_898126d8306a1f35</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the level of privileges an attacker must possess before successfully exploiting the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">possess</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["possess"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_f5166ba1f547dbc7" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_9bf6ead54114b2ce"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is unauthorized prior to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_326c774ac04668ed</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The attacker is unauthorized prior to attack, and therefore does not require any access to settings or files to carry out an attack</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">is unauthorized prior to</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["is unauthorized prior to"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_37d3ee327d9ae26a" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be exploited at will of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_42544919eee7410f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric determines whether the vulnerability can be exploited solely at the will of the attacker, or whether a separate user (or user-initiated process) must participate in some manner</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be exploited at will of</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be exploited at will of"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_c1411a9818cb4164" source="e_544178d28761a5ab" target="e_1e808dd568a942dd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be scored relative to impacted component If</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_63771ce0c8d221b8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If so, the Base Score increases and the Confidentiality, Integrity and Authentication metrics should be scored relative to the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be scored relative to impacted component If</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be scored relative to impacted component If"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_8926a27fbb154525" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_1e808dd568a942dd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be scored relative to impacted component If</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c9a55194eecc2bf0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If so, the Base Score increases and the Confidentiality, Integrity and Authentication metrics should be scored relative to the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be scored relative to impacted component If</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</d