ion</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be provide"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_a4eb1f28999f8467" source="e_77070ae0c105017e" target="e_a20dd191299ea97d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be integrated</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1f94910d0f7486ed</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Microsoft SharePoint is a ubiquitous, web-based collaboration and document management platform deeply integrated into the Microsoft 365 ecosystem</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be integrated</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be integrated"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_0d0add4f8fe477bf" source="e_57c45a346543d062" target="e_d3df058ff984d927"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">present high-risk attack surface</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b982a510b12e7941</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Because SharePoint acts as a critical bridge between internal users, active directories, and cloud infrastructure, vulnerabilities within its architecture present a high-risk attack surface</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">present high-risk attack surface</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["present high-risk attack surface"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_c14fceaccac60c40" source="e_57c45a346543d062" target="e_6902a7680a7319ed"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">present high-risk attack surface</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d222cf9ca5730cd1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Because SharePoint acts as a critical bridge between internal users, active directories, and cloud infrastructure, vulnerabilities within its architecture present a high-risk attack surface</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">present high-risk attack surface</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["present high-risk attack surface"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_eebd2b1514107e39" source="e_791de43fccfd7f2f" target="e_e6e90eb94c09e808"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">acts as critical bridge between</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_112a3ea932b90e8e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Because SharePoint acts as a critical bridge between internal users, active directories, and cloud infrastructure, vulnerabilities within its architecture present a high-risk attack surface</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">acts as critical bridge between</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["acts as critical bridge between"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_b3566e74844a6423" source="e_05efe0da27589031" target="e_83f09256e9e71bb6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">perform arbitrary operations such as</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6f68092e7f9660d7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">By crafting a custom .NET gadget chain, an attacker can perform arbitrary operations such as executing an attacker-controlled OS command</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">perform arbitrary operations such as</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["perform arbitrary operations such as"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_21883de8bda5315e" source="e_17d9e7d2f2eada95" target="e_b1d71ecff3a572ce"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is executed with permission of Windows service</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6b0a5fd245bc2034</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The attacker's arbitrary code is executed with the permission of the Windows service account running the SharePoint Site instance</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">is executed with permission of Windows service</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["is executed with permission of Windows service"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_aa88222b88415897" source="e_17d9e7d2f2eada95" target="e_b1d71ecff3a572ce"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is executed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_07b690e1e5697644</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The attacker's arbitrary code is executed with the permission of the Windows service account running the SharePoint Site instance</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">is executed</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["is executed"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_f7ccb82b84f7330e" source="e_fbfb70a00355d68e" target="e_056762b3f0d13b70"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be chained to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_696a8c8782537dca</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">As CVE-2026-63520 can be chained to the authentication bypass vulnerability, CVE-2026-55040, the resulting exploit chain allows for unauthenticated RCE against a vulnerable server</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be chained to</data><data key="edge_domain">CVE</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be chained to"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_5ff0e0a339468371" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_6f86ae8844c3ae87"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">was discovered by Senior Principal Security Researcher at</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_dab9ca22fcbc6afd</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This vulnerability was discovered by Stephen Fewer, Senior Principal Security Researcher at Rapid7 and is being disclosed in accordance with Rapid7's vulnerability disclosure policy</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">was discovered by Senior Principal Security Researcher at</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Organization</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["was discovered by Senior Principal Security Researcher at"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_f9fc2681ffe55600" source="e_543de26306ffec16" target="e_8e81ce852cc92461"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has been provided by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fd2e4ea2ce020c03</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The following statement has been provided by Microsoft:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">has been provided by</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Vendor</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["has been provided by"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_b99000547d13d6bc" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_3ad6428f27807baf"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">like to thank</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2f8ba14db1d6dd15</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">“We would like to thank Rapid7 for responsibly reporting this issue through coordinated vulnerability disclosure.”</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">like to thank</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Product</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["like to thank"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_97b0458bbb6a33fa" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_6f86ae8844c3ae87"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">like to thank</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2ef1a5bc33f51509</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">“We would like to thank Rapid7 for responsibly reporting this issue through coordinated vulnerability disclosure.”</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">like to thank</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Organization</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["like to thank"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_404a470c4a8598e4" source="e_3d8c93e609b395bb" target="e_fbfb70a00355d68e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be remediate</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3060d1d60f70a8ff</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The vendor has provided the following updates to remediate CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be remediate</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">CVE</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be remediate"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_9a8f3965e5580c96" source="e_dc1a92928d8fd579" target="e_f0e3798d5b1a489d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">assess</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6543e227be45571f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Customers can assess their exposure to the authentication bypass vulnerability, CVE-2026-55040, with authenticated vulnerability checks available in the July 15 content release</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">assess</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["assess"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_fc8c8ce2f70e8893" source="e_8e81ce852cc92461" target="e_5488ed963ae57722"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">acknowledges receipt of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_843091acd990e690</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.c