</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be scored", "be scoring"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_567326f33b86d70d" source="e_c4631f903e1159e5" target="e_c7bbd6f495adf548"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_307e2aeb6a82c597</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An exploited vulnerability can only affect resources managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be managed by</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be managed by"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_79ce836f12dab867" source="e_0651ca14b1e582f2" target="e_41977bbb956fd210"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are same In</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_227c735abcc21401</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In this case, the vulnerable component and the impacted component are either the same, or both are managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">are same In</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["are same In"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_9294c0ba3608ce3c" source="e_26e0466f06957bd3" target="e_41977bbb956fd210"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are same In</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_031877e223d88a0e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In this case, the vulnerable component and the impacted component are either the same, or both are managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">are same In</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["are same In"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_c26693bb08f4c7a7" source="e_22d8a27b5ffe2dfd" target="e_c7bbd6f495adf548"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_21d9f3dc99ba5300</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In this case, the vulnerable component and the impacted component are either the same, or both are managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">are managed by</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["are managed by"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_91de3fa222a18ab6" source="e_841d5cae83210039" target="e_c1b8569aebaf6353"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9a55f2c389d9b530</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric measures the impact to the confidentiality of the information resources managed by a software component due to a successfully exploited vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be managed by</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be managed by"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_482a9efaa853dd4e" source="e_fabb36a448bb30b7" target="e_eb1797b298a230c0"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">disclosed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_63a6ddc7c5e8378e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, access to only some restricted information is obtained, but the disclosed information presents a direct, serious impact</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">disclosed</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["disclosed"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_2c4f5ef99a939b4b" source="e_d2b630e61129d09b" target="e_26e0466f06957bd3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be protected by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3b7778b514b35f85</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, the attacker is able to modify any/all files protected by the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be protected by</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be protected by"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_886a2419dca2c79e" source="e_332fd4a216e1c401" target="e_2228b2b192c550b5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be resulting from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f27b57738829c8c0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric measures the impact to the availability of the impacted component resulting from a successfully exploited vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be resulting from</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be resulting from"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_54355548032a6ab7" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_841d5cae83210039"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8014cb934806c245</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["refers to accessibility of"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_a0af84d4cfbcc45d" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_bf0bee0969a73481"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9b3492437e2abd14</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["refers to accessibility of"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_58444858b5d1be47" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_d37e8eb9896152d1"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_accc42413d71a059</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["refers to accessibility of"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_26eba3f10dd2c1dc" source="e_22e800482ee5b5fd" target="e_4058f076b2d4719d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">consume</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fc06f90b4213640a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">consume</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["consume"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_94772fae67689dab" source="e_527c56c7674a26dd" target="e_904da0b4f3960fb3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is important factor for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ce8d9bca095ca822</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Remediation Level of a vulnerability is an important factor for prioritization</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">is important factor for</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["is important factor for"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_297b86311faf4f81" source="e_4228490cbf8a6d91" target="e_98c110f1e21aa4eb"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is unpatched when</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c054950d94ae3b86</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The typical vulnerability is unpatched when initially published</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">is unpatched when</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["is unpatched when"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_b7f113b6d3804a5c" source="e_edf56b768b8904e2" target="e_a568574ebde0ab4b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">becomes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e4a4b1aba7631936</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Each of these respective stages adjusts the temporal score downwards, reflecting the decreasing urgency as remediation becomes final</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">becomes</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["becomes", "has become"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_1f2d04b3e6ca2182" source="e_298a9593b67b7b1f" target="e_34cf20183f45e324"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has issued</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a17d72146e1d168a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Either the vendor has issued an official patch, or an upgrade is available</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">has issued</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["has issued"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_43cb1722d64480ab" source="e_298a9593b67b7b1f" target="e_d068a0aa82ac3043"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has issued</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1edb5ae154636901</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Either the vendor has issued an official patch, or an upgrade is available</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">has issued</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["has issued"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_68c7f7e6159cbae3" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_cf4606d100a09d0c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is known to exist with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bb8b0c7cedd99d1c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The urgency of a vulnerability is higher when a vulnerability is known to exist with certainty</data