e</data><data key="edge_evidence">Impact should stop there; while an attacker may be able to use these credentials to later execute code as the administrator, it is not known that the attacker has access to a login prompt or method to execute commands with those credentials</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be execute code as</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be execute code as"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_23e7c17d0872f272" source="e_dd36d981d34aaf68" target="e_0a74ab6b8c124112"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be execute</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6eeaf5117c215352</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C09</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Impact should stop there; while an attacker may be able to use these credentials to later execute code as the administrator, it is not known that the attacker has access to a login prompt or method to execute commands with those credentials</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data><data key="edge_predicate_canonical">be execute</data><data key="edge_domain">Mention</data><data key="edge_range">Mention</data><data key="edge_derived_from">["be execute"]</data></edge><edge id="oe_6c6be7a6df709b14" source="e_5962be0a3867e263" target="e_1ad4fa20584b7a30"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">send trivial crafted request to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_5fa90c015db8af45</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C09</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="ed